    "about": {
        "ja": "EXPO2025マニアックマップについて",
        "en": "about EXPO2025 Maniacs Map"
    },
    "about_message": {
        "ja": "EXPO2025の会場マップを閲覧できるサイトです。<br>万博終了に伴い、アーカイブサイトとして進化させていきます。<br>会場マップはOpenStreetMapを利用しています。<br>開発サイト: <a href='https://github.com/K-Sakanoshita/expo2025-maniacs'>https://github.com/K-Sakanoshita/expo2025-maniacs</a>",
        "en": "This is a site where you can view the EXPO 2025 venue map. <br>As the Expo ends, this will evolve as an archive site. <br>The venue map uses OpenStreetMap.<br>Develop Site: <a href='https://github.com/K-Sakanoshita/expo2025-maniacs'>https://github.com/K-Sakanoshita/expo2025-maniacs</a>"
    },
    "owner": {
        "ja": "",
        "en": ""
    },
    "licence_title": {
        "ja": "利用しているデータについて",
        "en": "About the data being used"
    },
    "licence_message": {
        "ja": "このサイトで使われているデータは、OpenStreetMapとプロジェクトのデータを組み合わせています。<br>3Dモデル（CC BY 4.0）：<a href='./assets/models/poi/vending-machine/SOURCE.md' target='_blank'>JPN vending machine by adenotoxin</a>、<a href='./assets/models/poi/drinking-water/SOURCE.md' target='_blank'>Low poly Drinking Fountain by omri_ha_muglob</a>、<a href='./assets/models/poi/bench/SOURCE.md' target='_blank'>CC0 - Bench by plaggy</a>（via Sketchfab）。<a href='https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/' target='_blank'>ライセンス</a><br><a href='./assets/models/playground/poly-pizza/composite-play-structure/SOURCE.md' target='_blank'>Play Structure by Emmett “TawpShelf” Baber [CC-BY]</a> / <a href='./assets/models/playground/poly-pizza/seesaw/SOURCE.md' target='_blank'>Seesaw by Poly by Google [CC-BY 3.0]</a> (via Poly Pizza).",
        "en": "The data used on this site is a combination of OpenStreetMap and project data.<br>3D models (CC BY 4.0): <a href='./assets/models/poi/vending-machine/SOURCE.md' target='_blank'>JPN vending machine by adenotoxin</a>, <a href='./assets/models/poi/drinking-water/SOURCE.md' target='_blank'>Low poly Drinking Fountain by omri_ha_muglob</a>, <a href='./assets/models/poi/bench/SOURCE.md' target='_blank'>CC0 - Bench by plaggy</a> (via Sketchfab). <a href='https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/' target='_blank'>License</a><br><a href='./assets/models/playground/poly-pizza/composite-play-structure/SOURCE.md' target='_blank'>Play Structure by Emmett “TawpShelf” Baber [CC-BY]</a> / <a href='./assets/models/playground/poly-pizza/seesaw/SOURCE.md' target='_blank'>Seesaw by Poly by Google [CC-BY 3.0]</a> (via Poly Pizza)."
    },
